[{"title":"咏史 其四 谢安","author":"陈普","text":"苻氏无良妄自尊，鲜卑羌竖正鲸吞。\n到头棋酒消磨晋，莫道桓冲果失言。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7384,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 谢安","author":"陈普","text":"地陷天倾不废棋，谢安阮籍好同时。\n江东残局危亡势，似太元初尚可为。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7385,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 韩愈","author":"陈普","text":"杨墨蛇龙本一区，大颠便是恶溪鱼。\n退之也是无操守，一贬便陈封禅书。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7386,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 鲁肃","author":"陈普","text":"龙虎鹓雏总可人，当阳倾盖便兰金。\n荆州尺寸都相付，始是当年子敬心。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7387,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 窦氏二女","author":"陈普","text":"冰霜不肯受尘埃，携手同糜百丈崖。\n熊掌嚼来似鸡肋，问君何事苦关怀。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7388,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其九 蜀先主","author":"陈普","text":"少年白帝死如生，但为云长也自荣。\n龙虎已分南北路，英雄无计与年争。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7389,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其十一 蜀先主","author":"陈普","text":"西行不与本心符，西负刘璋东负吴。\n汉业此时如累卵，天公先与杀周瑜。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7390,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其七 蜀先主","author":"陈普","text":"养虎荆州岁欲阑，一家豚犬不胜安。\n振振公族麟之角，妄作山林猛兽看。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7391,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其三 蜀先主","author":"陈普","text":"北投南走若穷猿，极目苍梧欲断魂。\n如许英雄不成事，止缘的是靖王孙。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7392,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其五 蜀先主","author":"陈普","text":"袁涣当年死亦甘，云长平昔竟何贪。\n刘巴项领刚如铁，也用随群拜武担。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7393,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 蜀先主","author":"陈普","text":"两得徐州不自由，中原应不恋炎刘。\n孙曹袁吕非蟊贼，五采龙文在益州。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7394,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其十 蜀先主","author":"陈普","text":"平生信义满乾坤，曾吊诸侯未返魂。\n吕布来时枭送洛，不应投许又投袁。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7395,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 蜀先主","author":"陈普","text":"白头上峓历群蛮，展转亡张又失关。\n取得益州竟何益，不如卖履看人间。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7396,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其八 蜀先主","author":"陈普","text":"如流岁月几沾襟，侍立霜严剧苦心。\n说与刘璋无怨怒，有人驱虎入山林。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7397,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其六 蜀先主","author":"陈普","text":"荆楚留连似失时，涪城欢饮类狐疑。\n军中刘晔誇言语，岂识英雄为义迟。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7398,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其四 蜀先主","author":"陈普","text":"徐元直去马超来，顾惜三纲又爱才。\n道御英雄无不可，豫州翻向益州来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7399,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 慕容垂","author":"陈普","text":"国亡家破此心全，氐与鲜卑两付天。\n王猛开心似诸葛，风云无望白头年。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7400,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 慕容恪","author":"陈普","text":"霜雹风沙杂乱飞，段龛城下见春归。\n时来但处周公位，历举华人百世希。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7401,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其三 慕容恪","author":"陈普","text":"一听芭蕉叶上寒，鼻头倍益旧时酸。\n河清未遇三千岁，水手犹轻十八滩。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7402,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其四 慕容恪","author":"陈普","text":"傅说济川空道在，彦方贩鬻叹时难。\n年来惟有樽空虑，一任滔滔溉倒澜。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7403,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 颜杲卿","author":"陈普","text":"骊宫歌笑入青云，曾识常山有战尘。\n忠骨已澌馀发在，因人得见梦中身。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7404,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 魏徵","author":"陈普","text":"东宫无德倚仪刑，又似当年傅建成。\n可笑郑公如百舌，春前夏后两般声。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7405,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 一暴十寒","author":"陈普","text":"一粒微阳稍兆和，严凝莫奈雪霜多。\n天人胜负为消长，造物其如所息何。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7406,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 人不可以无耻","author":"陈普","text":"耻字在人为甚大，根心羞恶不容无。\n所存所失分岐路，为蹠为尧遂两途。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7407,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 大丈夫","author":"陈普","text":"玉食珍羞不谓荣，箪瓢陋巷岂为贫。\n亭亭当当无偏倚，宇宙纲常任自身。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7408,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 大成","author":"陈普","text":"任与清和犹是器，偏于所执不相通。\n大成之德该全体，万理同归一贯中。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7409,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 子路喜闻过","author":"陈普","text":"讳疾之人每忌医，夫谁有过喜人规。\n仲由勇义能如此，令闻无穷百世师。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7410,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 不动心","author":"陈普","text":"见道分明了不疑，气常无暴志常持。\n确乎理气为标准，变故艰危岂足移。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7411,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 不愧不怍","author":"陈普","text":"己私净尽复何为，触处逢原与理随。\n心广体胖无所累，浩然之气未尝亏。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7412,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 不遇鲁侯","author":"陈普","text":"齐梁旧事惯常陈，道运湮微且莫伸。\n便使臧仓无阻间，鲁侯未是有为人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7413,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 为贫而仕","author":"陈普","text":"君子入官须事道，仕而非道似非常。\n抱关击柝虽卑贱，职分终然不可忘。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7414,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 井未及泉","author":"陈普","text":"井深九仞已劳功，未及于泉等是空。\n学问垂成还自弃，有为何异不为同。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7415,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 仁者人也","author":"陈普","text":"真精二者合而凝，形气中涵太极真。\n道即是身身即道，从来道外本无身。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7416,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 仁者无敌","author":"陈普","text":"仁人所在人心萃，鱼爵丛渊固自归。\n天命到头还不外，东征西怨岂容违。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7417,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 仁熟","author":"陈普","text":"虽然仁道系心根，熟处工夫在所存。\n惟是日新常不息，取之左右自逢原。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7418,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 今乐古乐","author":"陈普","text":"韶濩无声郑卫淫，纪纲条理杳难寻。\n虽然古乐非今乐，又与民同无古今。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7419,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 公孙衍张仪","author":"陈普","text":"虎狼纵暴互奔驰，狐魅纷纭擅肆欺。\n三二百年天地里，十棚木偶弄婴儿。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7420,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 天民","author":"陈普","text":"皇天赋予各成形，万理兼该备自身。\n所谓天民非有别，能全所赋以为人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7421,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 天吏","author":"陈普","text":"生杀存亡我敢专，德刑予夺出诸天。\n曰天所命惟其理，夫岂谆谆告语然。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7422,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 天位","author":"陈普","text":"天位待贤良有以，理天之物治天民。\n近来职掌归西邸，不是朋亲即富人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7423,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 天爵","author":"陈普","text":"利名物外奚必用，至贵无亏备自身。\n舍己从人徒取贱，到头还自丧其真。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7424,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 天爵","author":"陈普","text":"天爵在人非我有，重轻取予系于人。\n要知良贵人难夺，德义尊荣本自身。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7425,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 巨室","author":"陈普","text":"豮豕之牙须有道，执牛之尾岂良图。\n乱臣贼子乾坤里，天地人心未必无。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7426,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 心官则思","author":"陈普","text":"心严内主役群形，百体钦承顺令行。\n若失所思随欲动，反为形役自纷争。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7427,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 文公三年之丧","author":"陈普","text":"性善之言一动心，至诚恻怛出天真。\n纷纷狗彘乾坤里，独有居庐啜粥人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7428,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 牛山","author":"陈普","text":"气化流行出一元，生生之理自天根。\n倘无斤斧牛羊累，触处均沾雨露恩。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7429,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 王政","author":"陈普","text":"分地因天各有宜，财成辅相只当为。\n相忘禄产沾濡重，皞皞浑浑自不知。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7430,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 王道劝齐王","author":"陈普","text":"列国分争几百年，人心天命不其然。\n俗儒槩执春秋义，何忍斯民久倒悬。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7431,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 王霸","author":"陈普","text":"德诚已有奚容力，假伪非由力莫为。\n若使桓文居万里，不知功效竟何施。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7432,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 乍见入井","author":"陈普","text":"乍见无从那处生，非思非勉出天真。\n苟无物欲相攻夺，人性如何有不仁。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7433,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 圣人人伦之至","author":"陈普","text":"圆头方腹一皆人，尧舜元非凤与麟。\n道德文章光万世，看来只是尽人伦。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7434,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 正命","author":"陈普","text":"脩身尽道素无愆，变故之来出自天。\n比死见刳申子死，亦皆义理所当然。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7435,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 生之谓性","author":"陈普","text":"理气虽然不可无，形而上下有精粗。\n槩将动作名为性，天地同为牛马区。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7436,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 生忧患死安乐","author":"陈普","text":"路向平夷多折轴，或因危阻遂安全。\n吉凶岂必皆由命，畏玩之中各有天。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7437,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 夷之","author":"陈普","text":"厚葬非徒识所先，分明至爱自心根。\n怃然一悟奚从发，为有良知尚未昏。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7438,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 存心养性","author":"陈普","text":"心体能存无走作，油然义理自中生。\n更无物欲相攻伐，萌檗欣欣竞向荣。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7439,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 尧舜之道孝悌","author":"陈普","text":"尧舜巍巍道极隆，岂徒行止疾徐中。\n事亲敬长根天性，愚智由来一本同。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7440,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 尧舜之道陈王","author":"陈普","text":"自贼其君固不恭，责难陈善乃为忠。\n要知尧舜夫何道，只在常言仁义中。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7441,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 尽心知性","author":"陈普","text":"心具良知所性根，若非穷理亦能昏。\n心须物格无馀蕴，藩蔽开除本体存。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7442,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 当务为急","author":"陈普","text":"道之所贵通全体，何暇区区旋较量。\n惟是纲维无所作，千条万目自分张。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7443,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 有庳","author":"陈普","text":"弟兄小忍与堪怜，公义私情获两全。\n管叔若教封有庳，如凶凶罪岂无偏。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7444,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 百里奚","author":"陈普","text":"贫来刍牧竟何疑，只是要秦一事非。\n爵禄无心殊已久，谁能白首恋轻肥。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7445,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 自得","author":"陈普","text":"勿助勿忘随所事，潜心积虑孰加功。\n待须默识心融后，左右逢原触处通。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7446,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 自暴自弃","author":"陈普","text":"所性自来非不善，居参豚犬岂人情。\n昭昭日月明如镜，瞑目甘心冒昧行。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7447,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 行所无事","author":"陈普","text":"天理须殊本自然，自然天道合无天。\n一毫小智生穿凿，所性之真已弗全。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7448,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 许行","author":"陈普","text":"治国兼耕岂理欤，阴谋乱政肆崎岖。\n仲尼若使为司寇，许子难逃两观诛。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7449,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 齐人妻妾","author":"陈普","text":"箪瓢门柝不堪贫，奴婢甘心自屈身。\n驷马高车光郡国，看来等是乞墦人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7450,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 忧忧喜喜","author":"陈普","text":"骨肉真情出不期，捐阶盖井我何知。\n风埃满目閒来往，天性曾无一点疵。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7451,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 时雨之教","author":"陈普","text":"善教惟迎欲发机，神方启沃妙乎时。\n沛然化境无留滞，弄月吟风自不知。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7452,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 杞柳","author":"陈普","text":"梓漆椅桐质本奇，用而为器始皆宜。\n倘令杞柳非柔顺，未必杯棬可得为。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7453,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 求放心","author":"陈普","text":"放豚无迹竞西奔，著意追求孰用功。\n惟必操存能主敬，依然不离这腔中。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7454,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 私淑","author":"陈普","text":"百有馀年泽未穷，寒潭秋月寸心同。\n尼山想像人如玉，夜半相逢梦寐中。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7455,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 良知良能","author":"陈普","text":"孩提亲长根天性，尧舜由来共一初。\n情欲既趋天者灭，反疑性恶复何如。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7456,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 赤子之心","author":"陈普","text":"真淳未凿本诸天，饮食啼号所性然。\n情欲不生无外诱，圣人之质自浑全。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7457,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 具体而微","author":"陈普","text":"道体本来无限量，其间细大竞差殊。\n只争思勉些微累，意必之心未绝无。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7458,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}}]